 ### Session Identification
 
-Sessions are identified by the project folder name from `~/.pi/agent/sessions/{project}/`.
+The local identity candidate uses the source session ID and reported working directory. An absent working directory stays unknown. Version 2 and 3 trees require entry IDs and valid parent links. Copied sessions count once after renames. Forks require their parent file in the selected folders. Legacy records without IDs, conflicting records, and ambiguous lineage fail the scan without a partial report. This candidate is unpublished.
 
